  {
   "xml_index": 13,
   "xml_name": "PS1_013_MON_Leap Year Check",
   "display_name": "MON_Leap Year Check",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Every 4 years, an extra day (29th February) is added to the calendar to keep it lined up with the Earth's orbit - a year with this extra day is called a <b>leap year</b>.</p>\n<p>The exact rule to check if a year is a leap year is:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The year must be divisible by 4, <b>AND</b></li>\n<li>if the year is also divisible by 100, it is <b>only</b> a leap year if it is <b>also</b> divisible by 400.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In other words: 2024 is a leap year (divisible by 4, not by 100). 1900 is <b>not</b> a leap year (divisible by 4 and 100, but not by 400). 2000 <b>is</b> a leap year (divisible by 4, 100, and 400).</p>\n<p>Write a Python program that reads a year (a positive integer) and prints <code>Leap Year</code> or <code>Not a Leap Year</code>, using the exact rule above.</p>\n<p><b>Example 1:</b> Input: <pre>2024</pre> Output: <pre>Leap Year</pre></p>\n<p><b>Example 2:</b> Input: <pre>1900</pre> Output: <pre>Not a Leap Year</pre></p>\n<p><b>Example 3:</b> Input: <pre>2000</pre> Output: <pre>Leap Year</pre></p>",
   "answerpreload": "",
   "mark": 2.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "",
     "stdin": "2024",
     "expected": "Leap Year",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "",
     "stdin": "1900",
     "expected": "Not a Leap Year",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "",
     "stdin": "2000",
     "expected": "Leap Year",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "",
     "stdin": "2023",
     "expected": "Not a Leap Year",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "",
     "stdin": "2400",
     "expected": "Leap Year",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    }
   ]
  },
